msgstr "作为 CLI 使用"

#: ../../source/quick-start.rst:21 9464196669e244cd9fbba2d8e9f69f3d
msgid ""
"Point ``socid_extractor`` at a profile URL and it fetches the page and "
"prints one ``field: value`` per line:"
msgstr "将 ``socid_extractor`` 指向一个个人资料页 URL，它便会抓取该页面，并逐行打印 ``field: value``\\ ："

#: ../../source/quick-start.rst:35 1e4955724a394b248ce2bcc320341302
msgid ""
"**Batch tip.** Pass ``--skip-fetch-if-no-url-hint`` to skip the HTTP request"
" when the URL doesn't match any known site hint (faster for large batches, "
"but may skip generic engines such as forum templates):"
msgstr ""
"**批量处理提示。** 传入 ``--skip-fetch-if-no-url-hint`` 可在 URL 不匹配任何已知站点提示时跳过 HTTP "
"请求（对大批量处理更快，但可能会跳过论坛模板等通用引擎）："

#: ../../source/quick-start.rst:44 77837ab9d3404f429446e5c89196880b
msgid "As a Python library"
msgstr "作为 Python 库使用"

#: ../../source/quick-start.rst:46 ff1bce87bc0d41d8b1dcd82e11050a6d
msgid ""
"Fetch the page yourself, then hand the response text to "
":func:`~socid_extractor.extract`:"
msgstr "自行抓取页面，然后将响应文本交给 :func:`~socid_extractor.extract`："

#: ../../source/quick-start.rst:60 481ceae38ae149659425f51a14241242
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``extract()`` is a pure function over the response body — it never makes "
"network requests itself. The returned dict uses the normalized field names "
"from the :doc:`ontology`, plus an ``_extractor`` key naming the scheme that "
"matched. If no scheme matches it returns ``{}``."
msgstr ""
"``extract()`` 是一个作用于响应体的纯函数——它本身从不发起网络请求。返回的字典使用来自 :doc:`ontology` "
"的规范化字段名，外加一个 ``_extractor`` 键，用于标明匹配到的提取方案。如果没有任何方案匹配，则返回 ``{}``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/quick-start.rst:66 6b9a655fbdb64ab4b7f4d10533bb5c69
msgid "Where to go next"
msgstr "接下来该看什么"

